WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
01 · Create the starting strands. New → Draw strand. Start with one orange and one gold lace.

00:04.000 --> 00:12.000
02 · Attach four arms. Attach a new strand to each free endpoint. Watch the layers grow.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
03 · Position the ends. Use Move to arrange the arms around the centre.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
04 · Lock the crossing. Weave: orange 1_2 goes over gold 2_3.

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
05 · Explore one completed level. Orbit the camera to see the real thickness and over-under weave.

